From 54aa2669a6125cc4b5899336360c625552b8de89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: legsmechanical <joshgaine@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 14 Jun 2026 14:57:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(fx): Send FX + Move FX buses + generic FX-bus picker

Combined Send FX (2 post-fader buses A/B) and Move FX (4 per-Move-track insert
buses) sharing one generic FX-bus picker (Shift+Vol+Menu -> Master + Send A/B +
Move 1-4), ported onto the refactored chain split (chain_{json,params,mod,midi,
patch}.c + chain_internal.h).

- chain_patch.c: shared send + move preset stores (heap-built JSON via
  extract_fx_section_dup, atomic write), mirroring the master-preset block;
  arrays + protos declared CHAIN_INTERNAL in chain_internal.h.
- chain_host.c: send/move preset dispatch in v2_set/get_param; fx3/fx4 chain
  insert-slot routing + read paths (knob/param lookup, value readback) extended
  to the 4th slot (chain_params.c).
- shadow side: shadow_chain_mgmt hosts send buses (A/B, 4 slots, Send A->B
  routing, per-bus return) + Move FX buses (4 insert blocks); shim mix path;
  generic bus editor (shadow_ui_master_fx.mjs); FX_BUS_PICKER + co-run overlay
  entry (shadow_ui.js, shadow_ui_slots.mjs).

Fork build: MOVE_FX_BLOCKS=4, SEND_FX_SLOTS=4, 4 chain insert FX. Co-run comes
from upstream (#94/#112/#113/#114); our granular co-run + the obviated
master-buffer / json-null fixes were dropped in the rebase.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
