From 79a244e390dc3f75d8188e1e461482926eb91c8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: legsmechanical <joshgaine@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 09:05:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(chain): route fx3/fx4 get_param so slot FX blocks 3-4
 open their param page

v2_get_param routed synth:/fx1:/fx2:/midi_fx1:/midi_fx2: but had no fx3:/fx4:
branch, so get_param("fx3:ui_hierarchy") fell through to the unprefixed-synth
fallback and returned -1. The shadow UI then saw a null hierarchy and
dead-ended on the unclickable "No presets" browser for the fork's 3rd/4th
slot FX blocks (blocks 1-2 worked; set path, render, and JS already handled 4).

Add fx3:/fx4: get_param routing mirroring fx1/fx2 (indices 2/3, guarded by
fx_count). Fork-only divergence (slot synth-chain raised 2->4); document it
plus the remaining fx1/fx2-only activation asymmetries in CLAUDE.md.

